          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imagine um array como uma barra de inventário. Um slot pode armazenar qualquer variável ou valor, seja uma string, booleano ou número como <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cada elemento em um array tem uma posição numerada chamada de índice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os índices começam em 0 e aumentam com cada valor subsequente. Isso significa que o segundo elemento em <code>playerStats</code> está no índice <code>1</code>. Codifique esse índice.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para acessar um elemento como o valor <code>true</code>, codifique o nome do array <code>playerStats</code> seguido pelo índice do elemento entre colchetes <code>[2]</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>playerStats</code> seguido de <code>[</code> e depois <code>2</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para atualizar o valor no segundo índice, acesse-o através de <code>playerStats[2]</code>, em seguida use <code>=</code> para atribuir um novo valor como <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>playerStats[2]</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apesar de ter quatro elementos no array, o último índice que podemos acessar é <code>3</code> porque a indexação começa em 0.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais tipos de valores um array pode armazenar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Qualquer valor, incluindo strings, números e booleans</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apenas strings</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Qualquer valor, incluindo strings, números e booleans.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147905,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como chamamos a posição de um elemento em um array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O índice do elemento</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O número do elemento</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O índice do elemento.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual índice o elemento neste array possui?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como acessamos um elemento neste array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>loot[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>loot[\"gem\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>loot[1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como atualizamos um valor em um array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Acessamos o valor pelo seu índice e, em seguida, atribuímos outro valor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos atualizar valores em arrays</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Acessamos o valor pelo seu índice e, em seguida, atribuímos outro valor.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais índices podemos acessar em um array com dois elementos?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code> e <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> e <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code> e <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique o valor <code>false</code> neste array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameOptions = [\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
