            "id": 147911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Certifique-se de que <code>\"sword\"</code> esteja no índice <code>0</code>, e <code>\"shield\"</code> esteja no índice <code>1</code>, codificando <code>\"sword\"</code> e depois <code>\"shield\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;bow&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equipment = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(equipment);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"sword\"</code> seguido de <code>\"shield\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
